  "html": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>优秀作品示例</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">精选平台上线的优质车机主题，供开发者参考学习。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/668c5c82454c4b98ab469b7aa1358a69.jpg?auth_key=1795675073-b1bd054b87144d8d94eb78d17f1f5df8-0-62c7507ae8455799d10ce39017301a515e9f424be318cff05f1a774ea9ccdd7a\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/48c697af8b5a46ba92585fd015a045ec.mp4?auth_key=1795675073-955b0ebed3684108b1c9bacd3809bb85-0-0f7a88f8abf804f5d4ff36f5e75c20b1e2d3f1b0fbd1857d9527d81177262710\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：Honey</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 玫瑰星球</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：玫瑰坠入星河，你落在我心上</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：随机播放，含昼夜模式。双击切换不同星球状态</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/1bd6956b06024f46b239873ca3ad8353.jpg?auth_key=1795675073-c9a102e78d6844ff9d0fde39f2f1d8a8-0-2ce9a3d14a9ed71c8a1f49642623e661239651a58909957fb4e4589b154218ef\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e87adc86f5dc4dfa8ac311b93d6db475.mp4?auth_key=1795675073-bc2f4e7a8e7c489485562adf2c578e92-0-d8bb35237a8253e1f9aa8fd690a2a3f9b61860f4a27292f59d20f3d5c6494f3c\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：Rui睿睿</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 原点</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：被遗忘在宇宙尽头的角落，一束光落在肩上，独自前行，也是探索的起点</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：顺序播放+过渡动画，双击切换多种状态</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a4f3932acac2407f91cc950ee173d4fd.jpg?auth_key=1795675073-0d1685b985614d5d8575b3ad6188ea4c-0-aa80ad2a96a36fbfe71a97c9a58e1db3a2b355ab50f3ab25235131288064caf7\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/460852b1f5c04f9bb753b2f478f35db5.mp4?auth_key=1795675073-55a093328cdf453ab2560d950494866e-0-d7a6ac30a4a25a786ace13f037d7c6dec9aad3f6cd084749cc6ce0e915cd549a\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：沙丁酱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 云栖</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：松松软软的泡沫云朵，堆叠在蓝天的画布上。昼夜两种色彩，双击切换萌趣状态。放松，从看到云朵的那刻开始</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：顺序播放+过渡动画，含昼夜模式。双击切换萌趣状态</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/dc06d88f4c5f4ea6b14a74222e758bb0.jpg?auth_key=1795675073-cb7999fecf2d4469a5363e0ddd19fbe5-0-af8d448f92ffd9bfaa37a99b6d79740816970c2dbeb4b7b62189074e7fef343b\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/2f70be5b6c0d4855aa6a1275df84bcfc.mp4?auth_key=1795675073-c0659cb81a374b28ab7b2c734875f8bf-0-5eac511d766fd355f4124c9cf01e695e2938c2004c054eb3d8c024df1bc5b708\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：YOMeeDoll有咪兜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 小企鹅兜兜-宠鹅海岛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：小企鹅兜兜躺平泡汤、远航垂钓、沉浸式海岛下午茶，双击解锁兜兜的松弛假日吧。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：主场景串联，双击企鹅岛上5处带有小企鹅兜兜的画面区域，即可解锁对应动态场景，再次双击即可返回主岛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/9fe93173bda9456a914a1f17a29e81ed.jpg?auth_key=1795675073-63a82683b6a94a95b7d486b5f6c2b804-0-8715451e552f0d4d9f74bf17ced1f211e78aeb794337773ba5995191324e93f6\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/fd147517112546f0adec0d5151592918.mp4?auth_key=1795675073-299c4d1b788b4e42a66e73e6747da035-0-cc1b2647256e0a80d8a7d827d1c7a8ddf9f8c065eaae3492571b84a737ee0000\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：YOMeeDoll有咪兜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】: &nbsp; 小企鹅兜兜-露营日记</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：和企鹅兜兜一起露营，让生活慢下来。双击屏幕，换种野法</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：主场景串联，</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">含昼夜模式。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">双击左中右热区切换不同场景</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><br></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/67e09513abf74cfbb2f89a25a2e48fa8.jpg?auth_key=1795675073-19999c0211f442edb7f1ce059a304f91-0-da6b1907e1d9ab3505f68cbefc554842bd981bef7c74d36c35ee982c46ee3832\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/51686a71f3864d5cb2778ce949f3f0ed.mp4?auth_key=1795675073-04f886c79f1b431da89b88e83baf6a9f-0-d0a4ef610b7f73836a16e415a53e5d6f56fa0624030c6e1464d9ec5ecb4bbc77\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【作者】：夏语猫</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题名称】:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;疯癫杀马特</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【主题简介】：视觉冲击力极强的灵魂爆炸头小猫，五种疯癫状态随机切换，专治各种无聊。双击，解锁下一个疯癫瞬间</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【交互方式】：随机播放+过渡动画，双击切换不同疯癫状态</span></p>"
}
